Wá àwọn ẹ̀yà','Search the installed translations'=>'Wá inú àwọn ìtúmọ̀ tí a ti fi sórí ẹ̀rọ','Select all'=>'Yan gbogbo rẹ̀','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'Dín iye àwọn ẹ̀yà tí o yàn kù: kò gbọdọ̀ ju %1$d iṣẹ́ lọ ní ìgbà kọ̀ọ̀kan (o yan %2$d).','Send report'=>'Fi ìròyìn ránṣẹ́','Service plan'=>'Ìgbékalẹ̀ iṣẹ́','Settings'=>'Àwọn ètò','Share error reports'=>'Pín àwọn ìròyìn àṣìṣe','Share this report'=>'Pín ìròyìn yìí','Show a new restore code'=>'Fi kóòdù tuntun láti mú padà bọ̀ sípò hàn','Show the "Report translation" entry in the admin toolbar'=>'Fi àkọsílẹ̀ "Ṣe ìròyìn ìtumọ̀" hàn nínú pẹpẹ irinṣẹ́ alábòójútó','Some of this component\'s text is hard-coded by its author and can\'t be translated by a language pack.'=>'Apá kan lára ọ̀rọ̀ èròjà yìí ni òǹkọ̀wé rẹ̀ kọ tààrà sínú kóòdù, àpò èdè kò sì lè túmọ̀ rẹ̀.','Status'=>'Ipò','Status unknown'=>'A kò mọ ipò rẹ̀','String context'=>'Àyíká ìlà ọ̀rọ̀','Suggested translation'=>'Ìtumọ̀ tí a dábàá','Supplementary translation index'=>'Atọ́ka ìtumọ̀ àfikún','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'A ti tún atọ́ka ìtumọ̀ àfikún kọ́.','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Ìtọ́jú atọ́ka ìtúmọ̀ àfikún','Supplementary translations'=>'Àwọn ìtumọ̀ àfikún','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'A dá ìṣàyẹ̀wò dúró láìsọ nǹkankan di aláìní òbí: %s.','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'Ṣíṣàyẹ̀wò ti parí: a pa fáìlì %d rẹ́.' . "\0" . 'Ṣíṣàyẹ̀wò ti parí: a pa àwọn fáìlì %d rẹ́.','Sweep now'=>'Ṣàyẹ̀wò báyìí','Sync complete.'=>'Ìmúṣiṣẹ́pọ̀ parí.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'A dúpẹ́. A ti fi ìròyìn rẹ ránṣẹ́.','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'A kò fi èròjà yẹn sórí ojú-òpó yìí, nítorí náà a kò lè béèrè ìtumọ̀ fún un.','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'Ìyẹn kò jọ kóòdù ìmúpadàbọ̀sípò.','That is not a valid WordPress locale code. Nothing was saved.'=>'Kì í ṣe kóòdù locale WordPress tó tọ́. A kò fi nǹkan kan pamọ́.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'Ìyẹn kì í ṣe àmì ìdánimọ̀ ìkọ́ tó tọ́.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'Atọ́ka ìtumọ̀ kò lè gba àyípadà náà sílẹ̀; jọ̀wọ́ tún gbìyànjú.','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'Ìmọ́tótó ti ṣiṣẹ́, ṣùgbọ́n a kò lè gba díẹ̀ lára àwọn àyípadà rẹ̀ sílẹ̀ nínú atọ́ka ìtumọ̀; ìmọ́tótó tó kàn yóò tún gbìyànjú wọn.','The component has no files that can be uploaded.'=>'Ẹ̀yà náà kò ní fáìlì kankan tí a lè gbé sókè.','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'Èròjà náà kò sí nínú àpò fáìlì plugins tàbí themes.','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'A kò rí Fáìlì àkọ́kọ́ èròjà náà.','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'Èsì ìgbàsílẹ̀ kò ní ibùdó tí a lè lò.','The entry opens a panel to search the translations Babilim installed on this site and report one of them.'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ náà ṣí pánẹ́ẹ̀lì kan láti wá àwọn ìtumọ̀ tí Babilim fi sori ojú òpó yìí àti láti ṣe ìròyìn ọ̀kan nínú wọn.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'Àpótí "%1$s" gùn jù: ó ní àmì %2$d, ààlà sì jẹ́ %3$d. A kò fi nǹkan kan ránṣẹ́; jọ̀wọ́ dín in kù kí o tún gbìyànjú.','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'Domain tí a fún \'%1$s\' kò bá slug \'%2$s\' ti manifest àpò náà mu, bẹ́ẹ̀ ni kò bá text_domain rẹ̀ \'%3$s\' mu.','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'A tún atọ́ka àdàpọ̀ fún \'%s\' kọ́, ṣùgbọ́n atọ́ka ìtumọ̀ kò lè gbà á sílẹ̀; àtúnkọ́ tó kàn yóò tún gbìyànjú.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'A óò fún àwọn ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù mìíràn tó fi ẹ̀yà kan náà sórí ẹ̀rọ ní ọ̀rọ̀ àtilẹ̀wá àti àwọn ìtumọ̀ tí a ṣe láti inú rẹ̀.','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'Àpò náà kò kéde fáìlì ìtúmọ̀ pàtàkì kankan.','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'Àpò náà kò ní %s fún text domain tirẹ̀.','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'kind \'%1$s\' inú manifest àpò náà kò bá kind tí a béèrè \'%2$s\' mu.','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'Àpò náà kò ṣe Fáìlì ìtumọ̀ àkọ́kọ́ tí a lè pèsè.','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'text domain \'%1$s\' ti àpò náà kò bá ẹ̀dà èròjà yìí lórí ojú òpó yìí (\'%2$s\') mu, nítorí náà a kò fi sórí ẹ̀rọ.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'A kò lè ka èròjà tí a ti kó jọ náà.','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'Ìpèníjà ìforúkọsílẹ̀ kò ní ìrísí tí a retí.','The report could not be sent.'=>'A kò lè fi ìròyìn náà ránṣẹ́.','The search could not be completed.'=>'A kò lè parí wíwá náà.','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'Iṣẹ́ náà bẹ̀ ojú-òpó yìí pé kí ó dúró kí ó tó tún ṣe ìmúṣiṣẹ́pọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Iṣẹ́ náà kò lè dé ojúlé rẹ. Ògiri-ààbò, ohun èlò ààbò tàbí òfin olùgbàlejò ni ó ṣeéṣe kó máa dí ìbéèrè náà; jọ̀wọ́ gba àwọn ìbéèrè sí /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge láàyè.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'Ìfilọ̀ ìgbésókè láti ọ̀dọ̀ iṣẹ́ náà kò pé.','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'A ti ń pèsè text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) fún èròjà mìíràn tí a fi sórí ẹ̀rọ (%3$s); a kò fi nǹkan kan sórí ẹ̀rọ.','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'A óò pa ohun tí a gbé lọ mọ́ títí tí o fi máa béèrè lọ́wọ́ Babilim láti pa á rẹ́.','Theme'=>'Àkòrí','Theme · %s'=>'Àkòrí · %s','Themes'=>'Àwọn àkòrí','There is no upload in progress.'=>'Kò sí ìgbésókè fáìlì kankan tó ń lọ lọ́wọ́.','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'Kò sí ìgbésókè fáìlì kankan tó ń dúró de ìfọwọ́sí.','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'Àwọn wọ̀nyí ni èdè tí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí ń lò. O lè yí wọn padà nínú %s.','These fields will be sent:'=>'A ó fi àwọn pápá wọ̀nyí ránṣẹ́:','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Ẹ̀dà yìí kì í ṣe èyí tí ojú-òpó yìí mọ̀ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ fún èròjà/locale yìí.','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Èròjà yìí kò sọ nọ́mbà ẹ̀dà, nítorí náà a kò lè béèrè ìtumọ̀ fún un.','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'Èròjà yìí tóbi ju èyí tí iṣẹ́ náà gbà lọ, nítorí náà a kò lè gbé e sókè.','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'A ti gbé èròjà yìí sókè tẹ́lẹ̀. Babilim ń ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ báyìí.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Nọ́mbà ẹ̀dà èròjà yìí gùn ju %d àmì lọ, Babilim kò sì lè bójú tó èyí, nítorí náà a kò lè béèrè ìtúmọ̀ fún un.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'Èyí yóò fúnni ní kóòdù tuntun láti mú padà bọ̀ sípò, èyí tó ṣáájú kò sì ní ṣiṣẹ́ mọ́. Tẹ̀síwájú?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì yìí ní ojú-òpó púpọ̀ jù láti ṣàyẹ̀wò wọn ní ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan, àwọn kan lára wọn sì lè jẹ́ èyí tí a ṣètò láti pa ìdánimọ̀ Babilim wọn rẹ́ nígbà tí a bá pa èròjà náà rẹ́. A kò lè mú ìwé-àṣẹ onísanwó tí a so mọ́ ojú-òpó bẹ́ẹ̀ padà bọ̀ sípò láìfọwọ́yí; ìwọ yóò ní láti kan sí ìrànlọ́wọ́ Babilim ní %s. Láti pa àwọn ìdánimọ̀ mọ́, tẹ Fagilé, yọ àmì kúrò ní "Pa gbogbo dátà Babilim rẹ́ nígbà yíyọ kúrò" nínú àwọn ètò Babilim ojú-òpó kọ̀ọ̀kan, kí o sì dá a dúró lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i. Ṣé kí a dá a dúró bí ó ti wù kí ó rí?','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'Ẹ̀dà àfikún yìí fúnra rẹ̀, kí iṣẹ́ náà lè sọ fún ọ pé kí o ṣe ìmúdójúìwọ̀n rẹ̀ bí ẹ̀dà náà bá ti pẹ́ jù láti bá iṣẹ́ náà sọ̀rọ̀.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Ìròyìn yìí kò dárúkọ ohun èlò ìrànlọ́wọ́ tàbí àkòrí àti locale tó tọ́.','This report does not name an installed string.'=>'Ìròyìn yìí kò dárúkọ ọ̀rọ̀ kankan tí a ti fi sori ẹrọ.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'Ìròyìn yìí kò ní ẹ̀dà tó tọ́ láti ròyìn lé lórí.','This report will be posted publicly on GitHub and may be kept by third parties.'=>'A ó fi ìròyìn yìí sí gbangba lórí GitHub, àwọn ẹnikẹta sì lè fi pamọ́.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'A kò dá kóòdù ìmúpadàbọ̀sípò yìí mọ̀ fún sáyẹ́ẹ̀tì yìí.','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Ojúlé yìí ti ní ìforúkọsílẹ̀ tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ tí a kò lè gbà padà láìfọwọ́yí mọ́.','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'Ojú-òpó yìí ní àwọn èròjà %1$d ní àwọn èdè %2$d, èyí tó nílò àwọn ìdì àyẹ̀wò %3$d; Babilim lè ṣe ìdì %4$d péré ní ìgbà kọ̀ọ̀kan. Dín àwọn èdè tí a ń ṣàkóso kù nínú Ètò, tàbí pa àwọn plugin àti àwọn àkòrí tí a kò lò, lẹ́yìn náà tẹ Ṣàyẹ̀wò lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i báyìí.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Ojú-òpó yìí kò ní ríra kankan tí a lè fi kóòdù hàn fún.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'Ojúlé yìí ti ní ìwé àṣẹ. Tún ojúewé náà gbé.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'A kò tíì forúkọ ojúlé yìí sílẹ̀ pẹ̀lú Babilim.','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Ojúlé yìí ju ìwọ̀n tí iṣẹ́ náà gbà nínú ìmúṣiṣẹ́pọ̀ kan lọ, nítorí náà a fi àwọn nǹkan kan sílẹ̀: èròjà %1$d àti locale %2$d.','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'Ojúlé yìí jẹ́ apá nẹ́tíwọ̀kì ojúlé púpọ̀, tí kì í fi àwọn ìtúmọ̀ tuntun sórí ẹ̀rọ láìfọwọ́yí. Àwọn ìtúmọ̀ tí a ti fi sórí ẹ̀rọ ṣì ń gba ìmúdójúìwọ̀n.','This site is verified.'=>'A ti fìdí ojúlé yìí múlẹ̀.','This site must be verified first.'=>'A gbọ́dọ̀ kọ́kọ́ fìdí ojú-òpó yìí múlẹ̀.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'URL ojú-òpó yìí, kí iṣẹ́ náà lè jẹ́rìí sí i pé tìrẹ ni.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'Àdírẹ́sì ojú-òpó yìí gùn jù fún Babilim láti forúkọ rẹ̀ sílẹ̀.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'locale tí a ṣètò fún ojú òpó yìí.','This site\'s install public key, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ gbangba ìfisórí ojú-òpó yìí, tí a ń lò láti fi hàn pé àwọn ìbéèrè wá láti ojú-òpó yìí lóòótọ́. Ìdajì gbangba nìkan ni a máa ń fi ránṣẹ́.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'Kóòdù locale ojú-òpó yìí kì í ṣe èyí tí Babilim lè forúkọ sílẹ̀.','This string can\'t be reported from this site.'=>'A kò lè ròyìn ọ̀rọ̀ yìí láti ojúlé yìí.','This string is not among the translations installed on this site. Search again and pick it from the list.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ yìí kò sí lára àwọn ìtumọ̀ tí a fi sori ojú-òpó yìí. Wá lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i kí o sì yàn án láti inú àtòkọ.','This translation was updated since you searched. Search again and pick the string from the new list.'=>'A ti ṣe ìmúdójúìwọ̀n ìtumọ̀ yìí látìgbà tí o ti wá. Wá lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i kí o sì yan ọ̀rọ̀ náà láti inú àtòkọ tuntun.','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'Láti túmọ̀ èròjà yìí, Babilim nílò orísun rẹ̀.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Ìgbìyànjú pọ̀ jù. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i lọ́la.','Too many reports today. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Àwọn ìròyìn pọ̀ jù lónìí. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i lọ́la.','Too many requests.'=>'Ìbéèrè pọ̀ jù.','Toolbar'=>'Pẹpẹ irinṣẹ́','Translating…'=>'Ń túmọ̀…','Translation does not load'=>'Ìtúmọ̀ kò gbé jáde','Translation failed'=>'Ìtumọ̀ kùnà','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'Àwọn fáìlì ìtúmọ̀ tí o bá fi sínú %s máa ń gba ipò àkọ́kọ́ ju ti Babilim lọ. A máa pa wọ́n mọ́ àfi tí o bá yọ àmì yìí kúrò.','Translation requested.'=>'A ti béèrè ìtúmọ̀.','Translations'=>'Àwọn ìtúmọ̀','Type'=>'Irú','Type at least 2 characters to search.'=>'Tẹ ó kéré tán àmì méjì láti ṣàwárí.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Ìdáhùn HTTP %d tí a kò retí.','Uninstall'=>'Yíyọ kúrò','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Irú tí a kò mọ̀: %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Domain tí kò láàbò: %s','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Locale tí kò ní ààbò: %s','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'Slug tí kò ní ààbò: %s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'text_domain tí kò ní ààbò: %s','Up to 20 pending diagnostic events (e.g. a file that failed its integrity check), each just a code, component, and locale, and never any string content or translated text.'=>'Títí dé àwọn ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ ìwádìí àṣìṣe 20 tí ó ń dúró (fún àpẹẹrẹ fáìlì tí ó kùnà ìṣàyẹ̀wò ìdúróṣinṣin), kọ̀ọ̀kan jẹ́ kóòdù, èròjà àti locale nìkan, kò sì ní ọ̀rọ̀ tàbí ìtumọ̀ kankan nínú.','Update'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe','Update available'=>'Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n wà','Updates'=>'Àwọn àtúnṣe','Updating…'=>'Ń ṣe àtúnṣe…','Upgrade this site'=>'Gbé sáyẹ́ẹ̀tì yìí ga','Upload and request'=>'Gbé lọ kí o sì béèrè','Upload cancelled.'=>'A ti fagilé gbígbé fáìlì sókè.','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'Gbígbé fáìlì sókè ti parí — a ti béèrè ìtúmọ̀.','Upload expired before it finished'=>'Àkókò ìgbésókè náà tán kí ó tó parí','Upload in progress — continue or cancel'=>'Ìgbésókè ń lọ lọ́wọ́ — tẹ̀síwájú tàbí fagilé','Upload this component?'=>'Gbé èròjà yìí sókè?','Upload was not accepted'=>'A kò gba ìgbésókè náà','Uploading'=>'Ń gbé sókè','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'Ń gbé apá %1$d nínú %2$d sókè…','Uploading…'=>'Ó ń gbé lọ…','Verified'=>'A ti fìdí rẹ̀ múlẹ̀','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'Èsì ìfọwọ́sí kò ní site_token.','Version %s'=>'Ẹ̀dà %s','What is sent when Babilim checks this site'=>'Ohun tí a fi ránṣẹ́ nígbà tí Babilim bá ṣàyẹ̀wò ojú-òpó yìí','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Ohun tí a fi ránṣẹ́ nígbà tí o bá mú Babilim ṣiṣẹ́','When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.'=>'Nígbà tí nǹkan bá kùnà nínú Babilim, fi ìròyìn àṣìṣe ránṣẹ́ sí Iṣẹ́ Babilim kí a lè tẹ̀ ẹ́ jáde gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀rọ̀ ìṣòro ti gbogbo ènìyàn lórí GitHub. A fi ìròyìn náà ránṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí èyí tó wá láti ojúlé yìí, pẹ̀lú ìfìdíṣẹ̀múlẹ̀ ìdánimọ̀ kan náà bí gbogbo ìbéèrè mìíràn sí Iṣẹ́ Babilim. Iṣẹ́ náà ń tẹ̀ kóòdù àṣìṣe àti àwọn ẹ̀dà nìkan jáde gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀rọ̀ ìṣòro ti gbogbo ènìyàn lórí GitHub; ọ̀rọ̀ ìṣòro ti gbogbo ènìyàn náà kò ní àdírẹ́sì ojúlé, àkóónú tàbí ọ̀nà fáìlì kankan. Ó wà ní pípa ní ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ (ìtò àkọ́kọ́).','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'Ibi tí o ti rí èyí (àṣàyàn)','While this is on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'Nígbà tí èyí bá wà ní títàn, àwọn ìtumọ̀ tí iṣẹ́ náà ṣàkójọ gẹ́gẹ́ bí èyí tó wà fún àwọn èdè tí o ń ṣàkóso ni a ó fi sori ẹrọ nígbà ìṣiṣẹ́pọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀mejì lójúmọ́.','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Wrong for this context'=>'Kò tọ́ fún àyíká yìí','Wrong meaning'=>'Ìtumọ̀ tí kò tọ́','Wrong plural form'=>'Fọ́ọ̀mù ìṣọ̀pọ̀ tí kò tọ́','Wrong term'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ tí kò tọ́','Yes'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ni','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'A kò gbà ọ́ láàyè láti ṣe èyí.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'Ẹ̀dà PHP rẹ, fún ìbáramu.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'Ẹ̀dà WordPress rẹ, láti pèsè àwọn fáìlì ìtúmọ̀ tó báramu.','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'Kóòdù tuntun rẹ láti mú padà bọ̀ sípò: %s. Fi pamọ́ sí ibi ààbò — kóòdù tó ṣáájú kò ṣiṣẹ́ mọ́.','Your report is processed automatically by AI models and may improve this translation for other sites.'=>'Àwọn àwòṣe AI ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ìròyìn rẹ láìsí ìdásí ènìyàn, ìròyìn náà sì lè mú ìtumọ̀ yìí dára sí i fún àwọn ojúlé mìíràn.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Ojú-òpó rẹ dáhùn, ṣùgbọ́n kì í ṣe pẹ̀lú ohun tí a retí. Ó ṣeé ṣe kí èròjà mìíràn tún REST API kọ, tàbí kí a ti fi ibi ìparí API yẹn pamọ́ sínú cache; jọ̀wọ́ yọ /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge kúrò nínú cache àti títúnkọ.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Ojúlé rẹ pẹ́ jù láti dáhùn. Jọ̀wọ́ gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i lẹ́yìn náà, kí o sì ṣàyẹ̀wò pé olùgbàlejò rẹ kò lọ́ra jù tàbí kò kún jù.','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Zip kò ní manifest.json.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Fáìlì default tí a nírètí kò sí nínú Zip: %s','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Fáìlì tí a nírètí kò sí nínú Zip: %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json ní ìṣètò tí a kò retí','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'a kò lè ka _manifest.json: %s','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest kò ní \'%s\' tàbí kò tọ̀.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'\'server_build_id\' inú expected_manifest kì í ṣe build id tó tọ̀.','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'Kò ṣeé ṣe láti ṣe ìtúpalẹ̀ _manifest.json: %s','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'yóò mú %1$d nínú %2$d àwọn èròjà tí a ṣàkóso di aláìní òbí (ju ìdajì lọ)','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'yóò sọ gbogbo èròjà %1$s tí a ń ṣàkóso di aláìní òbí (%2$d nínú %2$d)','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'Iye àkọsílẹ̀ l10n.php kò bá ara mu fún %s','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json ní \'default_domain_entries\' tí kò tọ̀.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json ní \'default_domain_files\' tí kò tọ̀.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'manifest.json tó wà nínú zip kì í ṣe JSON tó tọ̀.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'manifest.json kò ní \'%s\' tàbí kò tọ̀.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json kò ní \'build_no\' tàbí kò tọ̀.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json kò ní \'entries\' tàbí kò tọ̀.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json kò ní \'extra_domains\' tàbí kò tọ̀.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json kò ní \'files\' tàbí kò tọ̀.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'\'%s\' inú manifest.json kò bá iye tí a retí mu.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'\'contract\' inú manifest.json kì í ṣe ọ̀rọ̀ ẹ̀dà tó tọ̀.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'\'kind\' inú manifest.json gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ \'plugin\' tàbí \'theme\' (àwọn iye gangan).','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'\'server_build_id\' inú manifest.json kì í ṣe build id tó tọ̀.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'\'status\' inú manifest.json gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ \'published\'.','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ ọ̀rọ̀ hexadecimal.','per day'=>'lójoojúmọ́','rc_…'=>'rc_…','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'sha256 kò bá ara mu fún %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'sha256 kò bá ara mu fún default/%s','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'plugin','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'àkòrí','problem report categoryOther'=>'Òmíràn','translation statusAvailable'=>'Wà','translation statusInstalled'=>'A ti fi sori ẹrọ']];